    "sourceLine": "In June 2023, the US Poet Laureate, Ada Limén, unveiled a poem that she wrote for NASA's Europa Clipper, a poem that will be inscribed on the side of the spacecraft set for Jupiter's water moon, 1.8 billion miles away. As printed in the Danebank 2026 Trial HSC stimulus booklet.",
